# Android bui

*.lock
.claude/*
!.claude/guidelines.md
!.claude/guidelines/
app/release/
*.log

# -------------------------
# graphify
# -------------------------
# The graph itself is tracked: graphify ships a merge driver for graph.json and a
# post-checkout hook, both of which assume it is under version control. Only the
# extraction cache stays out - it is large, machine-local, and rebuildable.
graphify-out/cache/*

# Dated snapshots graphify writes before it overwrites a curated graph. Useful
# locally for recovering hand-written community names; noise in history.
graphify-out/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/

# Machine-local sidecars: absolute paths to this machine's Python and checkout.
# Wrong on every other machine, rewritten on each run.
graphify-out/.graphify_python
graphify-out/.graphify_root
